          "name": "MAC PDF Extraction v7",
          "versionChangeDescription": "Initial",
          "promptMessage": "Extract structured client data from a My Aged Care (MAC) referral PDF. Return ONLY valid JSON with these exact fields: first_name, last_name, gender (M/F/O), birthday (YYYY-MM-DD), external_id (MAC Aged Care ID e.g. AC27413301), language (en), timezone (Australia/Adelaide for SA), correspondence_method (mail for Post / email), phone_personal (mobile or null), phone_main (home or null), email (or null), address (street only), city, state, zip, country (AU), health_card (Medicare number), care_needs (2-3 sentence summary of recommended services from the assessment). Rules: Male=M Female=F. DOB DD/MM/YYYY convert to YYYY-MM-DD. Not applicable=null.",
          "isAgentSpecific": true
        }
      },
